      # - body: GenerateCollectionFormRequest body
      # - x_amzn_idempotency_key: A unique value which the server uses to recognize subsequent retries of the same request.
      # - x_amzn_shipping_business_id: Amazon shipping business to assume for this request. The default is AmazonShipping_UK.
      # - rate_limit: Requests per second
