      # - requested_pick_up_before: Get Shipment Details by passing Before Requested pickup date. Must be in {https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/iso-8601 ISO 8601} format.
      # - requested_pick_up_after: Get Shipment Details by passing After Requested pickup date. Must be in {https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/iso-8601 ISO 8601} format.
      # - scheduled_pick_up_before: Get Shipment Details by passing Before scheduled pickup date. Must be in {https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/iso-8601 ISO 8601} format.
